## ▶️ Installation & Setup

### 1. Clone the repository

```
git clone <your-repo-link>
cd project
```

### 2. Install dependencies

```
pip install flask requests
```

### 3. Install Ollama

Download and install from: https://ollama.com

### 4. Run AI model

```
ollama run phi3
```

### 5. Run the application

```
python app.py
```

### 6. Open in browser

```
http://127.0.0.1:5000/
```

